{"5159930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ODD ODDS", "steam_appid": 5159930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/e6d6ffa82948aa84aab3839a07a22e0b.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/e6d6ffa82948aa84aab3839a07a22e0b.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/e6d6ffa82948aa84aab3839a07a22e0b.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ODD ODDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your debt grows faster than you can pay it down. In front of you: a claw machine, an ATM, and a single typewriter. Every turn, a devil comes to collect. Come up short, and it ends there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ODD ODDS</i> is a roguelike gambling game about facing down your debt in one dimly lit room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 A physics-driven claw machine. Work the arm, take what you can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Reshape the arm. Change what drops. Rebuild the machine into your own way of earning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 Roguelike upgrades chosen at the typewriter each turn — no two runs the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈 Collection turns. Miss the number, and the run is over on the spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔔 Visitors who show up whenever they please. Allies — or something looking to feed on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💳 A hidden option inside the ATM, available only when you're out of road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ A poorly lit room and something demonic close by. Dark from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the machine. You work the ATM. You hit the keys of the typewriter.<br>Earning, growing stronger — all of it happens inside this room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only leave when the collector arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d7bd8dc1b36e3acd9c56e3e00d039e5e.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d7bd8dc1b36e3acd9c56e3e00d039e5e.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d7bd8dc1b36e3acd9c56e3e00d039e5e.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab, Cash Out, Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw Machine</strong> — Work the arm to pull coins and items out of the cabinet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATM</strong> — Cash in what you grabbed. It's the only way money comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typewriter</strong> — Take an upgrade each turn. Reshape the arm, swap out what drops — rebuild how you earn from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/870fdf6ae7566ce5d407921cdf7dc5a1.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/870fdf6ae7566ce5d407921cdf7dc5a1.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/870fdf6ae7566ce5d407921cdf7dc5a1.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Devil's Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few turns, a devil names a figure.<br>It comes straight out of your balance, and if you're short, the run ends. There is nothing to negotiate.<br>The figure keeps climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's over the moment your earnings stop keeping pace with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d6f2ef077370daa279e8e21d5c0ecd9a.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d6f2ef077370daa279e8e21d5c0ecd9a.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d6f2ef077370daa279e8e21d5c0ecd9a.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Intercom Rings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone is at the door.<br>Some of them are here to feed on you. Others have their own teeth bared at the devil.<br>Take the deal or send them away. When there's more than one offer on the table, decide which.<br>Who you listen to weighs more than how efficiently you earn.<br>Whether you ever get out of this room is settled right here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/b63d060f01ef5e8374c990bc2d4415f8.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/b63d060f01ef5e8374c990bc2d4415f8.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/b63d060f01ef5e8374c990bc2d4415f8.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Last Move</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ATM has a function that isn't on the menu.<br>Cut into a transfer between banks and take it for yourself. Pull it off and you're out of the hole — though obviously, it isn't clean.<br>It's only there when you have nothing left to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/8400db2e0d360f5b89bea1592bd6fd77.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/8400db2e0d360f5b89bea1592bd6fd77.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/8400db2e0d360f5b89bea1592bd6fd77.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Last Thing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don't encourage gambling. ODD ODDS is a work of fiction about debt and terrible decisions. It does not endorse or promote real-world gambling. In-game currency and items have no real-world value and cannot be exchanged for money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/9de5a812b6758a1ff1247bfeb40292f8.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/9de5a812b6758a1ff1247bfeb40292f8.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/9de5a812b6758a1ff1247bfeb40292f8.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >P.S.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created with passion by four university students! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy it!!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/e6d6ffa82948aa84aab3839a07a22e0b.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/e6d6ffa82948aa84aab3839a07a22e0b.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/e6d6ffa82948aa84aab3839a07a22e0b.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ODD ODDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your debt grows faster than you can pay it down. In front of you: a claw machine, an ATM, and a single typewriter. Every turn, a devil comes to collect. Come up short, and it ends there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ODD ODDS</i> is a roguelike gambling game about facing down your debt in one dimly lit room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 A physics-driven claw machine. Work the arm, take what you can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Reshape the arm. Change what drops. Rebuild the machine into your own way of earning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 Roguelike upgrades chosen at the typewriter each turn — no two runs the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈 Collection turns. Miss the number, and the run is over on the spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔔 Visitors who show up whenever they please. Allies — or something looking to feed on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💳 A hidden option inside the ATM, available only when you're out of road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ A poorly lit room and something demonic close by. Dark from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the machine. You work the ATM. You hit the keys of the typewriter.<br>Earning, growing stronger — all of it happens inside this room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only leave when the collector arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d7bd8dc1b36e3acd9c56e3e00d039e5e.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d7bd8dc1b36e3acd9c56e3e00d039e5e.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d7bd8dc1b36e3acd9c56e3e00d039e5e.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab, Cash Out, Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw Machine</strong> — Work the arm to pull coins and items out of the cabinet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATM</strong> — Cash in what you grabbed. It's the only way money comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typewriter</strong> — Take an upgrade each turn. Reshape the arm, swap out what drops — rebuild how you earn from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/870fdf6ae7566ce5d407921cdf7dc5a1.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/870fdf6ae7566ce5d407921cdf7dc5a1.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/870fdf6ae7566ce5d407921cdf7dc5a1.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Devil's Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few turns, a devil names a figure.<br>It comes straight out of your balance, and if you're short, the run ends. There is nothing to negotiate.<br>The figure keeps climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's over the moment your earnings stop keeping pace with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d6f2ef077370daa279e8e21d5c0ecd9a.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d6f2ef077370daa279e8e21d5c0ecd9a.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/d6f2ef077370daa279e8e21d5c0ecd9a.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Intercom Rings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone is at the door.<br>Some of them are here to feed on you. Others have their own teeth bared at the devil.<br>Take the deal or send them away. When there's more than one offer on the table, decide which.<br>Who you listen to weighs more than how efficiently you earn.<br>Whether you ever get out of this room is settled right here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/b63d060f01ef5e8374c990bc2d4415f8.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/b63d060f01ef5e8374c990bc2d4415f8.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/b63d060f01ef5e8374c990bc2d4415f8.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Last Move</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ATM has a function that isn't on the menu.<br>Cut into a transfer between banks and take it for yourself. Pull it off and you're out of the hole — though obviously, it isn't clean.<br>It's only there when you have nothing left to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/8400db2e0d360f5b89bea1592bd6fd77.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/8400db2e0d360f5b89bea1592bd6fd77.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/8400db2e0d360f5b89bea1592bd6fd77.mp4?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Last Thing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don't encourage gambling. ODD ODDS is a work of fiction about debt and terrible decisions. It does not endorse or promote real-world gambling. In-game currency and items have no real-world value and cannot be exchanged for money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/9de5a812b6758a1ff1247bfeb40292f8.poster.avif?t=1788259449\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159930/extras/9de5a812b6758a1ff1247bfeb40292f8.webm?t=1788259449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/