"highlight": true}], "release_date": {"coming_soon": true, "date": "October 2026"}, "support_info": {"url": "", "email": "limitedfourtune@gmail.com"}, "background": "https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/5159930?t=1788259449", "background_raw": "https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/5159930?t=1788259449", "content_descriptors": {"ids": [5], "notes": "This game is set in a dark world centered on debt and its collection. It contains the following content.\r\n\r\nSimulated gambling\r\nThe core of play is operating chance-based machines (a crane game and a probability-driven roulette feature) to increase in-game currency. It does not replicate any real-world gambling service, and no real money or currency purchased with real money is ever used. In-game currency and items have no real-world value and cannot be exchanged for money.\r\n\r\nDepiction of criminal acts\r\nLaundering illicitly obtained funds, and seizing money by gaining unauthorized access to financial transfers, appear as in-game mechanics. These are fictional and are not presented as behavior to imitate.\r\n\r\nHeavy debt and its collection\r\nFailing to repay results in collection by a devil and ends the run. Some scenes are designed to be psychologically oppressive.\r\n\r\nOccult and demonic themes\r\nCharacters and effects use devils and occult motifs.\r\n\r\nIntense flashing lights\r\nCertain effects cause the screen to flash rapidly. Players with a history of photosensitive epilepsy should take care.\r\n\r\nThis game contains no sexual content, nudity, blood or gore, substance or alcohol abuse, or depictions of self-harm."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "10", "required_age": "10", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Medo"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "12", "required_age": "12", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Gewalt"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Simulasi dan/atau kegiatan judi\nHoror\nKekerasan"}}}}}